OpenDesign Docs was extracted from the OpenDesign project's docs-web app
at source revision 576ccbe. The editor source was not rewritten.

The upstream OpenDesign Project License applies MIT to source code.
That copyright and permission notice is preserved in LICENSE.
No curated third-party design dataset or third-party website asset library
is included. The bundled OpenDesign icon is used as a test fixture;
project names and logos do not grant trademark rights.

Historical test names refer to upstream specs 013–019. Repository extraction
is tracked here by spec 020; upstream commit history was not imported.

The numbered review-button rendering in src/bento-review-markers.ts is adapted
from Bento's slides/src/editor/comments.ts (CommentsUI.refresh), revision
01000838496ec863ba1035eae12a8a4943020cdc, https://github.com/nyblnet/bento.
OpenDesign adaptations use immutable-version HTML anchors, isolated shadow DOM,
viewport mismatch indicators and a source/channel-authenticated iframe bridge.
Bento's Store, collaboration transport and editor runtime are not imported.

